<http://example.org/sen0414-ch18corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapter 18 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.6.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch18corr-lineage/1.6.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch18corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.6.0 (2026-11-18): Page and release stories Done: chapter 18 page 9.99.2 (410 of 410 features), lambda-free A-box 1.0.3, review record. All four stories and eight tasks are Done; the lineage stays open until the owner confirms its closure."@en .

ex:TK9_Page_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Page 03-materials/ch18/page/sen0414_ch18_page_v9_99_2.html on template 9.53.5. Inputs: domain A-box 1.0.3 (03-materials/ch18/rdodi) made by maker 08-tooling/ch18-page/abox_lambda_free_make_v1_0_0.py, adapted from the chapter 20 maker (68 inputs rewritten, results equal 68 of 68, 0 lambda, 0 eval; the maker also handles err(lambda v=v: X) and an assigned lambda); page inputs from page_inputs_make_v9_99_2.py (examples_out_v3_0_0.json, stories_img_v9_99_2.json); page data 9.99.2 by page_data_v2_28_0 under Python 3.13.18; chapter code from manifest 1.1.0. The page's story texts are those of stories script 1.2.0, which this task did not change." .
ex:TK9_Page_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch18-page/logs_v9_99_2: full page test 410 features passed, 0 failed (the chapter-code tab lists the 27 deck examples in slide order and 27 of 27 run in the page); material check 1.0.2 on deck and page 8 of 8; manifest self-check pass; story layout probe pass. The page test ran to the end (page 9.96.2 on the old template stopped on a browser crash at 70). Run by the same agent that built the page; not independent." .
ex:TK9_Release_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Review record 08-tooling/ch18-deck/logs_v3_0_0/REVIEW_RECORD_ch18_v1_0_0.md: four reviewed conditions times three roles, 12 verdicts, labelled agent-made and not independent." .
ex:TK9_Release_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Every automatic check was re-run from the files after the page build (material check 1.0.2 8 of 8, deck standard 1.1.0 13 of 13, manifest self-check, overlap, story prose, story repeat, page test, story layout) and equals the record. NOT verified: independent review; links re-opened; the owner's reading of the re-cut story wording." .
ex:ST9_Page backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Page 9.99.2 built and tested; see its tasks." .
ex:ST9_Release backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Checks logged and review recorded; see its tasks." .

ex:Obs1_Obj9_PageTestFailing a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj9_PageTestFailing ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-18T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Page 9.99.2: 410 features passed, 0 failed, none left unrun (the baseline's 412 was an estimate from chapters 19-20; the number of features depends on the page)."@en .
ex:Obs2_Obj9_MaterialConditions a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj9_MaterialConditions ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-18T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Material check 1.0.2 on deck 3.0.0 and page 9.99.2: 8 of 8 pass (7 failed at the baseline)."@en .
ex:Obs1_Obj9_ReviewVerdicts a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj9_ReviewVerdicts ; backlog:observedValue 12 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-18T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "12 verdicts recorded, by the building agent, not independent."@en .
